  <div class="hint" style="margin-bottom:8px">Reg No: <span id="hReg"></span></div>
  <p><b>Instructions</b></p>
  <ul class="rules">
    <li><b>70 questions</b> randomly picked from the GS 208 bank, each with 4 options.</li>
    <li>Time allowed: <b>25 minutes</b>. The test submits itself when time is up.</li>
    <li>Options and questions are shuffled every attempt.</li>
    <li>If you refresh or close the page, your test continues from where you stopped (timer keeps running).</li>
    <li>You can move back and forth using Next, Previous or the question numbers.</li>
  </ul>
  <div class="row">
    <button class="btn" id="startBtn" onclick="startQuiz()">Start Test</button>
    <span id="resumeNote" class="hint"></span>
  </div>
